Ohio's&nbsp;<a href="https://oh-web.s3licensing.com/" >Wildlife Licensing System</a>, operated by the Ohio Department of Natural Resources, lets residents purchase hunting and fishing licenses, report game harvests, find training, and more.&nbsp;You can also manage your license and check game using the&nbsp;<a href="https://ohiodnr.gov/buy-and-apply/hunting-fishing-boating/hunting-resources/huntfishoh-mobile-app" >HuntFish OH mobile app</a> for iOS and Android.
